flatcitybuf provides CMake integration via an unofficial config-mode package.

  find_package(unofficial-flatcitybuf CONFIG REQUIRED)

Add the library and required CXX bridge source to your target:

  add_executable(my_app main.cpp ${FLATCITYBUF_CXX_BRIDGE_SOURCE})
  target_link_libraries(my_app PRIVATE unofficial::flatcitybuf::flatcitybuf)

Note: FLATCITYBUF_CXX_BRIDGE_SOURCE is set by find_package and points to
lib.rs.cc (the CXX bridge generated source). It must be compiled together
with your target — do not link it as a separate library.
